{"headword":"פְּקֻדָּה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.f. oversight, mustering, visitation, store</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:7\" href=\"/Hosea.9.7\">Ho 9:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 23:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.23.11\">1 Ch 23:11</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקֻדַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:32\" href=\"/Numbers.3.32\">Nu 3:32</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקֻדָּתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 109:8\" href=\"/Psalms.109.8\">109:8</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">פְּקֻדּ(וֹ)ת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.11\">Je 52:11</a> +;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>visitation:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"= punishment <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:7\" href=\"/Hosea.9.7\">Ho 9:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.3\">Is 10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:4\" href=\"/Micah.7.4\">Mi 7:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 9:1\" href=\"/Ezekiel.9.1\">Ez 9:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 16:29\" href=\"/Numbers.16.29\">Nu 16:29</a> (P), especially in <span dir=\"rtl\">(שְׁנַת)עֵת פְּקֻדָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.12\">Je 8:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.15\">10:15</a> + 6 times Je (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, עֵת²\" href=\"/BDB,_עֵת²\", dir=\"rtl\">עֵת</a> c. <span dir=\"rtl\">פָּקַד</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.15\">6:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 49:8\" href=\"/Jeremiah.49.8\">49:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:31\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.31\">50:31</a>), <span dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית הַפּ׳</span> = prison <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:11\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.11\">52:11</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"gracious visitation, providence <a data-ref=\"Job 10:12\" href=\"/Job.10.12\">Jb 10:12</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>oversight, charge</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:16\" href=\"/Numbers.4.16\">Nu 4:16</a> (P), also <a data-ref=